WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.456
[MUSIC]

00:00:07.456 --> 00:00:09.841
I'm an engineer by my
undergraduate education and

00:00:09.841 --> 00:00:12.229
an engineer by my postgraduate
education as well.

00:00:12.229 --> 00:00:17.372
One thing led to the other and commercial
real estate popped up, I was appointed

00:00:17.372 --> 00:00:21.847
as the global Chief Information Officer
in early March of 2020.

00:00:21.847 --> 00:00:25.977
I have to say that my leadership
through this journey of the company and

00:00:25.977 --> 00:00:30.459
the people in the company have benefited
greatly from my experience at SEP.

00:00:30.459 --> 00:00:35.043
The connection points that one
would build from the program, and

00:00:35.043 --> 00:00:39.542
how long lasting that will be,
and how that would transpire into

00:00:39.542 --> 00:00:44.396
meaningful things that either clusters
of us, or all of us would do.

00:00:44.396 --> 00:00:47.420
The 2019 SEP group had got together and

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:52.796
talked about building a fund that would
help entrepreneurs with much needed

00:00:52.796 --> 00:00:57.928
capital in areas that we thought we
believed in, as a collective group.

00:00:57.928 --> 00:01:03.685
I am very proud to say that that idea has
transformed into a company our focus is

00:01:03.685 --> 00:01:10.067
really around investments that conformed
to the principles of the Stanford slogan,

00:01:10.067 --> 00:01:14.165
change lives change
organizations change the world.

00:01:14.165 --> 00:01:22.732
[MUSIC]

